+|BPR02|**KSA Ex91, FBI2808–09**; February 4 $1,558 cash entry, cashier's-check image and original bank ledger debit/credit columns|Not acquired as the cited exhibit. Test the positive-deposit versus negative-Cash descriptions. Do not confuse with plaintiffs Ex91, the Ratchford declaration.|
